    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Merge API facilitates the seamless consolidation of shopping carts for users across multiple sessions or devices. This operation allows users to merge items from different carts into a single cart, enhancing their shopping experience and preventing item loss. Typically utilized by e-commerce platforms, this API is essential for maintaining continuity and convenience for customers during their shopping journeys. It serves developers looking to integrate robust cart functionalities into their applications.",
